        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 3308, Craftsman Mortise Entrance Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Craftsman Mortise Handleset is part of Emtek's American Heritage Collection. Its classic styling makes it a great choice for historic homes. With the textured plate and square cut-outs, the Craftsman Entrance Set has a rustic look that will make an impressive statement on any door. The Craftsman Mortise Entrance Handleset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions. It will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. This Emtek Craftsman Handleset has an ANSI F20 Heavy Duty Lock Body, which can be toggled to lock automatically upon closing the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek Craftsman Handleset and the ANSI F20 Heavy Duty Lock Body:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Deadlocking latch bolt with saw-proof inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick security latch.</li>\r\n<li>When the deadbolt is engaged, the outside thumb press is automatically locked.</li>\r\n<li>The latch bolt is retracted by the thumb press / knob / lever on either side, except when the outside thumb press is locked by stop button, then it can only be opened from the exterior by use of the key. Making it ideal for doors you want to automatically lock. This feature can be easily toggled on and off by pressing the stop and release button on the mortise box face.</li>\r\n<li>Operating the interior trim retracts both the deadbolt and the latch bolt for emergency egress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-diagram.jpg?v=1704354539\" width=\"189\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek F20 Diagram\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Craftsman Mortise Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Height: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Plate Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 3\"</li> \r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-3/4\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-3308-specifications.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>Emtek 3308 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-Mortise-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>Emtek ANSI F20 Mortise Box Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-Mortise-Install.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>Emtek ANSI F20 Mortise Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-3308-finish.jpg?v=1704354645\" width=\"456\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 3308 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
