                "description": "The Craftsman Mortise Handleset is part of Emtek's American Heritage Collection. Its classic styling makes it a great choice for historic homes. With the textured plate and square cut-outs, the Craftsman Entrance Set has a rustic look that will make an impressive statement on any door. The Craftsman Mortise Entrance Handleset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions. It will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. This Emtek Craftsman Handleset has an ANSI F20 Heavy Duty Lock Body, which can be toggled to lock automatically upon closing the door. \r\n",
